WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.224
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.224 --> 00:28.862
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.862 --> 00:36.570
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.570 --> 00:41.408
I seek boundless strength

00:41.408 --> 00:52.152
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.152 --> 00:54.211
I want to protect

00:54.254 --> 00:56.449
I want to believe

00:56.490 --> 01:00.861
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.861 --> 01:05.199
The heat and the love

01:05.199 --> 01:09.403
I accept them all

01:09.403 --> 01:12.906
I won't let go of your hand again

01:12.906 --> 01:21.712
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.291 --> 01:34.522
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:38.065 --> 01:41.568
So he's trying
to make Guren the key?

01:41.568 --> 01:43.404
Touda and Kazane...

01:43.404 --> 01:47.408
If Chishiki no Guuji has these
two keys in his possession,

01:47.408 --> 01:49.877
both Chibiki rocks
will be broken...

01:49.877 --> 01:53.244
and the armies of the dead
will invade the world of the living.

01:54.515 --> 01:57.718
You're going to be an onmyouji.
The ultimate one.

01:57.718 --> 02:00.050
The one that will
surpass Seimei.

02:00.154 --> 02:02.423
If that's what you desire...

02:02.423 --> 02:05.159
I'll do my best to
make that happen...

02:05.159 --> 02:07.261
I'll lend you my strength...

02:07.261 --> 02:10.389
After all, that's why...
I am by your side.

02:15.769 --> 02:18.932
Firegod Kagutsuchi's Flames
are Awe-inspiring

02:20.674 --> 02:25.236
Masahiro! Masahiro!

02:26.780 --> 02:31.615
- Hey wake up, Seimei's grandson!
- Mokkun!

02:32.052 --> 02:33.576
Are you okay?

02:34.288 --> 02:36.356
You looked like you
were having a bad dream.

02:36.356 --> 02:38.654
Yeah...

02:41.595 --> 02:44.393
Stay right here.
I'll prepare breakfast for you.

02:52.639 --> 02:54.334
Mokkun...

03:07.187 --> 03:09.485
What's the situation like
in the capital?

03:09.523 --> 03:11.525
Well, things are back to normal...

03:11.525 --> 03:15.427
and both the emperor and empress
have completely recovered.

03:16.130 --> 03:19.998
- I see.
- Hey, Masahiro...

03:23.504 --> 03:26.473
I'm sorry, maybe we can
talk about this later.

03:36.183 --> 03:38.777
How come Mokkun
is not around?

04:09.049 --> 04:12.712
Kurumanosuke...
Kurumanosuke!

04:19.826 --> 04:22.963
- So you're safe.
- Hey, grandson!

04:22.963 --> 04:24.988
- I've missed you so much!
- Grandson!

04:25.032 --> 04:27.100
So everybody's doing okay.

04:27.100 --> 04:29.503
Thank goodness we were able
to take refuge in him.

04:29.503 --> 04:31.772
What's up?
Are you going somewhere?

04:31.772 --> 04:35.868
- Yes, to Kifune.
- You don't look too good.

04:35.943 --> 04:38.478
All right, give him a hand
and help him inside!

04:38.478 --> 04:43.040
One, two! One, two!

04:43.884 --> 04:45.719
Is this okay?

04:45.719 --> 04:48.689
We'll be seeing you then!

04:48.689 --> 04:50.816
See you!

04:50.991 --> 04:53.926
Goodbye, grandson!

05:13.313 --> 05:17.217
Takaokami no Kami...
thanks for coming to see me.

05:17.217 --> 05:21.521
You look like someone
in need of an answer...

05:21.521 --> 05:23.819
Is it about Touda?

05:24.191 --> 05:27.327
Please tell me the truth,

05:27.327 --> 05:31.661
that everyone is hiding from me.
I'm begging you!

05:31.698 --> 05:34.635
Ignorance can be bliss.

05:34.635 --> 05:37.468
I have to rescue Guren!

05:39.706 --> 05:43.110
I don't believe he would
do anything to hurt me!

05:43.110 --> 05:46.446
He must have been
under some kind of spell.

05:46.446 --> 05:48.649
Just like you said...

05:48.649 --> 05:52.919
Someone is controlling
Touda's soul and he's being used.

05:52.919 --> 05:55.489
If I can just break
the spell that he's under...

05:55.489 --> 05:57.047
But it's too late.

05:57.391 --> 06:01.762
Touda's body will evolve into
a mass of supernatural energy,

06:01.762 --> 06:07.758
just like the spirits when the
capital was infected by the miasma.

06:08.368 --> 06:10.370
When that happens,

06:10.370 --> 06:12.861
Touda's soul will
disappear completely.

06:12.939 --> 06:15.806
Guren will... disappear?

06:21.615 --> 06:25.152
The only reason Touda is
still in his original form,

06:25.152 --> 06:29.248
is because Chishiki no Guuji
still needs him.

06:29.923 --> 06:34.257
Touda's blood is the key
to the returning path.

06:34.528 --> 06:38.692
Is there... any way
I can save Guren?

06:39.032 --> 06:41.023
No.

06:43.403 --> 06:46.973
There's a law that forbids a
shikigami from killing humans,

06:46.973 --> 06:49.407
or hurting them in any way.

06:49.443 --> 06:54.142
Do you know why
this rule even exists?

06:56.316 --> 06:59.217
That's because shikigami
are created by humans.

07:00.454 --> 07:03.256
Shikigami are formed
from human desires.

07:03.256 --> 07:08.694
The powers they possess stem
from the desires of human hearts.

07:08.995 --> 07:13.100
While shikigami are deities,
they are also human creations.

07:13.100 --> 07:16.035
Thus they cannot harm
humans beings.

07:17.137 --> 07:20.707
And because shikigami
are born of human desires,

07:20.707 --> 07:24.111
they can be revived
even if they die.

07:24.111 --> 07:27.447
But... their lives will
start anew.

07:27.447 --> 07:30.417
They will no longer take on
the same form,

07:30.417 --> 07:32.783
nor will they have any memory
of their former life.

07:35.021 --> 07:39.856
He will forget that you once
called him Guren.

07:40.660 --> 07:46.098
And never again will he assume
the form of a mononoke.

07:47.401 --> 07:52.031
He'll still be Touda.
But not the one you once knew.

07:52.105 --> 07:55.666
That means Guren
will no longer be...

07:56.410 --> 07:58.844
You'll lose something soon.

07:59.079 --> 08:02.071
Looks like you're going to
lose something.

08:02.382 --> 08:05.215
You have two choices
before you.

08:05.786 --> 08:12.419
Kill him and let him revive before
he turns into a paranormal mass.

08:12.859 --> 08:17.626
Or you can let him be absorbed
by the miasma and disappear.

08:17.664 --> 08:21.334
If Touda's blood is spilt
and the seal is broken,

08:21.334 --> 08:23.904
the world will be destroyed.

08:23.904 --> 08:28.942
What will you do? The Touda
can't be changed otherwise.

08:28.942 --> 08:35.348
Will you defeat him yourself or
let him vanish? You must decide.

08:35.348 --> 08:40.547
Once you're prepared,
I'll lend you my power.

08:44.825 --> 08:47.419
The power to kill a deity.

08:47.894 --> 08:51.421
To kill... a deity.

08:52.732 --> 08:55.702
Deities can only
be killed by other deities.

08:55.702 --> 08:57.737
With this power,

08:57.737 --> 09:02.609
even a child like yourself will
be able to destroy an immortal.

09:02.609 --> 09:07.147
But... I made
a promise with Mokkun...

09:07.147 --> 09:11.017
We would never abandon anyone...

09:11.017 --> 09:16.089
He said that when I
become a great onmyouji,

09:16.089 --> 09:21.228
he would lend me
his powers to help others.

09:21.228 --> 09:24.865
So why do I have
to kill Mokkun?

09:24.865 --> 09:29.336
Such compassion.
Let me offer you another option.

09:29.336 --> 09:32.072
Leave everything to me.

09:32.072 --> 09:37.110
Close your eyes and your ears,
see and hear nothing.

09:37.110 --> 09:44.184
Be still. Before you know it,
all of this will be over.

09:44.184 --> 09:47.676
You don't have
to decide right now.

09:49.623 --> 09:53.927
It is difficult to break the seals
while the world is under...

09:53.927 --> 10:00.100
the sun goddess Amaterasu and the
moon goddess Tsukuyomi's protection.

10:00.100 --> 10:03.503
So we have to wait
for the night of the new moon.

10:03.503 --> 10:06.301
Until then,
you should decide carefully.

10:07.207 --> 10:09.801
I will.

10:15.782 --> 10:20.014
There's no need for you to put
this much pressure on the boy.

10:20.220 --> 10:26.819
Kouchin of the 12 shikigami,
it's been a while since we met.

10:27.027 --> 10:30.830
I've simply taken on the daunting
task of telling him the truth.

10:30.830 --> 10:33.196
I thought you'd be grateful.

10:33.333 --> 10:36.769
Seimei was going to
tell him everything eventually.

10:40.006 --> 10:45.501
What kind of choices was
Seimei going to give him?

10:45.612 --> 10:52.018
I don't know, it's difficult
to predict his thoughts.

10:52.018 --> 10:54.350
I should go.

10:54.788 --> 10:59.748
It's a pity, I've become
quite fond of all of you.

11:13.473 --> 11:16.009
Are you sure
you're okay, Masahiro?

11:16.009 --> 11:21.381
I'm fine, and my wounds
have almost completely healed.

11:21.381 --> 11:24.884
Maybe you should
stay in bed a little longer.

11:24.884 --> 11:26.875
I'm going now.

11:41.067 --> 11:45.038
Masahiro?
Masahiro!

11:45.038 --> 11:48.441
- Toshitsugu.
- I heard you caught the flu.

11:48.441 --> 11:50.909
Are you sure you're
well enough to come back?

11:51.544 --> 11:54.672
Yes... I've completely recovered.

11:55.649 --> 11:58.675
But you don't look too good.

12:00.086 --> 12:01.688
Take the day off.

12:01.688 --> 12:02.422
What?

12:02.422 --> 12:07.293
Don't push yourself. I've done it
before and it was bad.

12:07.293 --> 12:10.230
I'll cover for you.

12:10.230 --> 12:12.332
Go home and rest.

12:12.332 --> 12:16.870
- But I...
- I'll tell the head of the dorms.

12:16.870 --> 12:19.839
Again, take care of yourself.

12:22.742 --> 12:24.539
Masahiro!

12:28.114 --> 12:29.949
Big Brother!

12:29.949 --> 12:31.885
I heard, Masahiro.

12:31.885 --> 12:34.521
You came to work for the
first time in the long time...

12:34.521 --> 12:36.723
and you're leaving so soon.

12:36.723 --> 12:39.658
- Yeah.
- Why don't you come to my house?

12:40.927 --> 12:43.163
I've got some effective
medication for your wounds.

12:43.163 --> 12:45.665
I'd wanted to send it over.

12:45.665 --> 12:49.157
Your nephews miss you too.

12:49.469 --> 12:52.005
- Uncle Masahiro!
- Let's play!

12:52.005 --> 12:52.739
Hey, hey!

12:52.739 --> 12:55.208
- This way!
- Over here!

12:55.208 --> 12:57.199
- Come on, Uncle Masahiro!
- Calm down!

12:57.477 --> 13:02.710
Your uncle's not feeling well,
don't be so rough!

13:04.884 --> 13:09.446
Masahiro, can I talk
to you for a sec?

13:13.426 --> 13:16.196
You're not acting yourself,

13:16.196 --> 13:19.563
and it's not because
you're still recovering.

13:20.400 --> 13:22.969
The next new moon night...

13:22.969 --> 13:25.572
What will happen? Don't fool me.

13:25.572 --> 13:27.574
I didn't rise
to my current position...

13:27.574 --> 13:30.610
just because
of my wife's connections.

13:30.610 --> 13:34.137
I'm an expert when it comes
to reading the Lunar calendar.

13:36.216 --> 13:38.377
Is it something
you can't discuss?

13:38.685 --> 13:42.722
- Well that's...
- Are you done, Uncle Masahiro?

13:42.722 --> 13:47.026
- Uncle Masahiro!
- Over here! Over here!

13:47.026 --> 13:51.765
- Hurry, we're over here!
- Uncle Masahiro, hurry up!

13:51.765 --> 13:54.801
- Hurry up!
- Just like you said,

13:54.801 --> 13:59.606
I have a decision to make before
the night of the next new moon.

13:59.606 --> 14:05.442
But it's something
I've got to figure out on my own.

14:08.848 --> 14:13.148
Uncle Masahiro, promise you'll
come play with us again!

14:20.226 --> 14:25.596
Uncle Masahiro was smiling,
but he seemed really sad.

14:31.971 --> 14:35.407
Rikugou, Taiin. Are you here?

14:37.310 --> 14:40.446
How's Tenitsu doing?

14:40.446 --> 14:45.110
- She's still recovering.
- Suzaku's been keeping vigil.

14:54.093 --> 14:58.865
- She's alive then.
- Of course! Tenitsu won't die!

14:58.865 --> 15:02.802
Suzaku will never
let that happen!

15:02.802 --> 15:06.172
Even if she dies
and is revived...

15:06.172 --> 15:08.163
her memories will be lost, right?

15:08.575 --> 15:11.635
Huh? Masahiro...

15:13.947 --> 15:16.983
Why don't you guys
head back first?

15:16.983 --> 15:19.786
I have to speak with
Kurumanosuke.

15:19.786 --> 15:22.922
But Seimei instructed us
to never leave your side.

15:22.922 --> 15:26.915
I'll be back as soon as
I'm done. Please...

15:27.260 --> 15:31.321
- Let's go, Taiin.
- W-Wait up, Rikugou!

15:32.265 --> 15:34.529
Don't take too long!

15:47.780 --> 15:50.510
Have you made your decision?

15:51.885 --> 15:54.615
Please lend me your power.

15:56.155 --> 15:58.491
Your power to kill a deity.

15:58.491 --> 16:01.494
Very well then...

16:01.494 --> 16:05.565
This is the power to kill a deity,
the fire of Kagutsuchi.

16:05.565 --> 16:10.502
- Kagutsuchi?
- This power is yours now.

16:21.848 --> 16:26.308
The ability to destroy
a deity now resides in you.

16:28.087 --> 16:32.217
But first, you'll need
an object to contain it.

16:32.325 --> 16:35.852
- An object?
- Don't look so worried.

16:35.895 --> 16:39.599
All you have to do
is borrow Suzaku's sword.

16:39.599 --> 16:43.002
You need something
that can cleanse and purify,

16:43.002 --> 16:46.239
and that sword is perfect.

16:46.239 --> 16:48.207
I understand.

16:49.409 --> 16:52.278
- One more thing...
- What is it?

16:52.278 --> 16:57.215
There's still something...
I need to ask of you.

17:05.892 --> 17:08.861
You're late!
You said you'd be home early!

17:08.861 --> 17:12.665
- Well, I'm back.
- And where have you been?

17:12.665 --> 17:15.468
I'll apologize
to Grandfather later.

17:15.468 --> 17:17.436
I need to talk to him first.

17:19.872 --> 17:23.035
- Grandfather.
- Come in.

17:32.552 --> 17:37.353
I met Takao no Kami and she's
lent me the fire of Kagutsuchi.

17:38.524 --> 17:42.551
I will... kill Guren!

17:43.296 --> 17:48.700
- I see.
- I have a favor to ask of you.

17:55.074 --> 17:59.204
- Very well.
- Thank you very much.

18:07.153 --> 18:11.391
That boy is
undoubtedly your grandson.

18:11.391 --> 18:14.326
Touda was right
about him all along.

18:15.428 --> 18:18.731
I'll go borrow
the sword from Suzaku.

18:18.731 --> 18:21.564
He is my heir.

18:25.104 --> 18:27.231
I've heard all about it,
Masahiro!

18:27.874 --> 18:31.310
- Toshitsugu.
- I heard you're going to Izumo,

18:31.310 --> 18:34.245
with the teacher
of the lunar calendar!

18:34.313 --> 18:37.617
Lord Yukinari's very pleased
to hear that too.

18:37.617 --> 18:40.347
You can go visit him later.

18:40.386 --> 18:42.616
Thank you, Toshitsugu.

18:44.791 --> 18:47.282
Narichika, Masahiro.

18:47.326 --> 18:53.433
I assume you boys have heard
everything from your grandfather.

18:53.433 --> 18:57.804
I'm sure you know the true purpose
of this expedition to Izumo.

18:57.804 --> 19:00.170
Yes, Father.

19:00.273 --> 19:02.375
You'll leave a little before me.

19:02.375 --> 19:06.038
I'll do my best to protect you.

19:06.079 --> 19:08.604
- So don't worry.
- Okay.

19:18.257 --> 19:20.316
I made you some rice balls.

19:20.393 --> 19:23.729
You can eat them even
when you're on the move.

19:23.729 --> 19:26.966
Thank you, Mother.

19:26.966 --> 19:30.265
You're really all grown up now.

19:32.071 --> 19:34.062
I'll be on my way.

19:36.542 --> 19:38.945
Mother, I was wondering...

19:38.945 --> 19:42.315
- What is it?
- Why don't you ask me?

19:42.315 --> 19:48.185
You never asked about this trip,
or how I got hurt the other time.

19:48.221 --> 19:51.524
You'll tell me when
you're ready.

19:51.524 --> 19:53.355
Mother...

19:55.061 --> 19:57.463
Good morning, Masahiro.

19:57.463 --> 19:59.897
Good morning, Akiko.

20:01.067 --> 20:03.399
- So you're leaving?
- Yeah.

20:03.703 --> 20:08.808
When... when you'll be back?

20:08.808 --> 20:12.979
- Will you be home before summer?
- Before summer?

20:12.979 --> 20:16.142
I was hoping we
could see the fireflies together.

20:17.750 --> 20:21.186
I'll try to come back
as soon as I can.

20:22.722 --> 20:25.748
Akiko... here.

20:26.058 --> 20:28.959
I can't lose this,
so I'm leaving it in your care.

20:29.629 --> 20:31.563
But it's...

20:36.235 --> 20:39.466
I want you to keep it for me.

20:40.506 --> 20:42.474
I understand.

20:51.250 --> 20:56.088
So, I see you have
the black robe.

20:56.088 --> 20:59.892
- Take this.
- Your rosary?

20:59.892 --> 21:02.328
I'll join you as soon as I can.

21:02.328 --> 21:05.729
I'm counting on everyone!

21:06.399 --> 21:08.799
All right, let's go!

21:12.271 --> 21:16.674
Everyone...
let's do this!

21:42.835 --> 21:54.447
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.447 --> 22:05.791
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.791 --> 22:11.530
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.530 --> 22:17.469
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.272 --> 22:29.649
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.649 --> 22:36.389
Because you taught me

22:36.389 --> 22:41.761
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.761 --> 22:47.433
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.433 --> 22:54.339
Surely surely surely

23:00.212 --> 23:03.147
Next Episode

23:24.203 --> 23:25.738
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.738 --> 23:27.206
Episode 24.

23:27.206 --> 23:29.731
Episode 24
The Wind of Dusk, the Eye of Dawn
The Wind of Dusk,
the Eye of Dawn.
